  "description": "CR 613.1b/704.5m Control Magic keeps a crewed Vehicle and loses it the instant the crew wears off",
  "note": "CR 613.1b's Attached arm reads only whether the source IS attached, never the host's projected type: CR 613.8a's dependency system is same-layer only, so the layer-2 grant cannot depend on the layer-4 crew effect (#3159). So Control Magic keeps a crewed Vehicle for as long as the crew lasts, and CR 704.5m's host check, which reads the full projection, buries the Aura once cleanup ends the crew (CR 514.2 / 301.7b), handing control back (CR 611.3b). bob crews Consulate Dreadnought with Hill Giant and Blind-Spot Giant in alice's upkeep, and alice steals it in her main phase.",
